  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21880354",
      "title": "The Route & Router Objects and the Composition API",
      "lectureOrder": 306,
      "videoOrder": 273,
      "sourceHash": "dd133a03f5f2c6b7a6836f2262f200da29a4c76a417bb039a8aa280d20045d06",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.35,
          "end": 4.04,
          "en": "What if we wanted to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.04,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "the dollar sign route object?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 9.94,
          "en": "Maybe, also because we're not just interested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.94,
          "end": 11.84,
          "en": "in our route parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.84,
          "end": 14.803,
          "en": "but in the query parameters or in the path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.96,
          "end": 17.41,
          "en": "Now, as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.41,
          "end": 19.71,
          "en": "that this key word does not exist here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.71,
          "end": 22.4,
          "en": "So we can't access this dollar sign route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.4,
          "end": 25.463,
          "en": "and we can't access this dollars sign router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 29.38,
          "en": "but we can import something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.35,
          "end": 34.193,
          "en": "from vue-router that will help us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.06,
          "end": 39.27,
          "en": "We can import a couple of built in hooks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.27,
          "end": 41.77,
          "en": "also called composables.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.77,
          "end": 46.25,
          "en": "Now what are hooks or composables?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.25,
          "end": 47.89,
          "en": "In the end these are different terms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.89,
          "end": 50.6,
          "en": "for a special kind of function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.6,
          "end": 54.56,
          "en": "hooks, composables, custom composition functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.56,
          "end": 58.55,
          "en": "These are special functions written in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.55,
          "end": 61.66,
          "en": "which are built for the composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.66,
          "end": 65.3,
          "en": "So for being used inside of the setup method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.3,
          "end": 70.05,
          "en": "these functions internally typically use some composition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.05,
          "end": 73.153,
          "en": "API features like Refs or Computed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.15,
          "end": 79.15,
          "en": "In a separate module later about reusing functionality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.35,
          "end": 82.07,
          "en": "you will learn how to build your own hooks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.07,
          "end": 84.96000000000001,
          "en": "your own custom composition functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.96000000000001,
          "end": 88.6,
          "en": "here the vue-router team did this for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.6,
          "end": 91.81,
          "en": "And it's giving us a couple of functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.81,
          "end": 94.06,
          "en": "a couple of composition functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.06,
          "end": 96.16,
          "en": "also called hooks or composables,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.16,
          "end": 99.65,
          "en": "which you can call inside of the setup method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.65,
          "end": 102.33,
          "en": "to then get access to certain features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.33,
          "end": 106.88,
          "en": "that work together nicely with the composition API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.88,
          "end": 108.92,
          "en": "and useRoute, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.92,
          "end": 111.91,
          "en": "allows us to get access to this route object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.91,
          "end": 113.333,
          "en": "here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 119.09,
          "en": "If we do this, I can console log route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.09,
          "end": 122.63,
          "en": "And if I do that, save this, and reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.63,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "and opened that console we see that is a reactive object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 131.003,
          "en": "and there for a proxy with all that route data in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.84,
          "end": 133.76,
          "en": "And since it's reactive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.76,
          "end": 137.3,
          "en": "we can of course watch it or use it in computer props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.3,
          "end": 139.74,
          "en": "to update any data that depends on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.74,
          "end": 141.97,
          "en": "whenever route changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.97,
          "end": 144.82,
          "en": "So with that instead of props PID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.82,
          "end": 148,
          "en": "we could also use route parents PID here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.21,
          "end": 151.13,
          "en": "that would be possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.13,
          "end": 153.273,
          "en": "And then of course we don't need props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 160.1,
          "en": "So if we use that go to the carpet, it works just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.1,
          "end": 163.4,
          "en": "but now using this route object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.4,
          "end": 167.17000000000002,
          "en": "which we get with help of the useRoute hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.17000000000002,
          "end": 169.75,
          "en": "or custom composition function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.75,
          "end": 171.8,
          "en": "also sometimes called composable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.8,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "whatever you wanna call it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 176.733,
          "en": "which is provided by the vue-router package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.8,
          "end": 180.74,
          "en": "And another composable another hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.74,
          "end": 183.31,
          "en": "which is also provided by vue-router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.31,
          "end": 185.9,
          "en": "can help us with the programmatic navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.9,
          "end": 190.48,
          "en": "and add product here in submit form in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.48,
          "end": 193.48,
          "en": "I wanna navigate to the all products page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.48,
          "end": 196.55,
          "en": "As soon as a product has been added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.55,
          "end": 198.82,
          "en": "in the options API world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.82,
          "end": 202.48,
          "en": "we would use this router push",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.48,
          "end": 206.18,
          "en": "and then go to slash products, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.18,
          "end": 208.35,
          "en": "In the composition API world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 212.46,
          "en": "the, this keyword doesn't exist and hence this doesn't work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.46,
          "end": 215.4,
          "en": "but again, the vue-router team has got us covered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.27,
          "end": 219.66,
          "en": "from vue-router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.66,
          "end": 221.997,
          "en": "we can import useRouter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.78,
          "end": 225.87,
          "en": "so not to useRoute like before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.87,
          "end": 227.573,
          "en": "but now use router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.97,
          "end": 233.97,
          "en": "And we can call this anywhere in our setup method like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 236.07,
          "end": 238.363,
          "en": "to get access to this router object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 239.35,
          "end": 242.95,
          "en": "And now we can simply call router push",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 242.95,
          "end": 246.11,
          "en": "using that router object we create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.11,
          "end": 248.87,
          "en": "by calling that custom composition function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.87,
          "end": 251.083,
          "en": "provided by the vue-router team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.66,
          "end": 256.113,
          "en": "So if we now save that and go to add product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.11,
          "end": 259.453,
          "en": "and I enter some data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.11,
          "end": 262.3,
          "en": "and click add product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.3,
          "end": 266.08,
          "en": "we're navigated to the all products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 266.08,
          "end": 268.78,
          "en": "And that is all I wanted to show here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 268.78,
          "end": 272.40999999999997,
          "en": "This is how you can use the vue-router in components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.40999999999997,
          "end": 275.13,
          "en": "that use the composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.13,
          "end": 278.32,
          "en": "Generally, the router works just as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 278.32,
          "end": 280.43,
          "en": "you define routes in the same way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.43,
          "end": 283.62,
          "en": "and you can use all the features you learn about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 283.62,
          "end": 286.37,
          "en": "But when it comes to dynamic parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.37,
          "end": 289.53,
          "en": "possibly passed to a component as props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 289.53,
          "end": 294.34000000000003,
          "en": "or when it comes to using the route or router object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.34000000000003,
          "end": 297.04,
          "en": "this is how you can use these features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.04,
          "end": 299.73,
          "en": "by using the custom composition functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 299.73,
          "end": 303.98,
          "en": "provided by the vue-router package or by using props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.98,
          "end": 306.467,
          "en": "as I showed it to you a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
